stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open: report submitted
    Open --> Assigned: creation rule matched type and group set
    Open --> Assigned: Service Desk triages manually
    Assigned --> InProgress: agent starts work
    InProgress --> Resolved: agent fixes it
    Resolved --> Closed: 48 h later (hourly trigger)
    Resolved --> InProgress: student says not fixed
    Assigned --> Escalated: SLA target missed
    InProgress --> Escalated: SLA target missed
    Escalated --> InProgress: lead intervenes
    Closed --> [*]
    state "In Progress" as InProgress
    state "Escalated (flag, not a status)" as Escalated
